  "sequence": [
    "Root must first grant an exact Native lane/GO for this SOURCE. Loading source/generator/comparison code does not invoke a tool.",
    "For each request, whole GO and exact request, unique slot initialization, external whole request/intent/armed checkpoint, separate model boundary, one original process_start, complete SDK external whole before isError/parse.",
    "Only the returned original job may be observed. Each process_status/process_read observer closes through its returned ID and every immutable page before another observer.",
    "Close authority and complete stdout/stderr before the next fixed request. For each pair, require equal full identity values and fixed ports before advancing to the next role.",
    "Missing ACK, timeout, permission failure, missing sysctl/file, wrong ABI/model format, nonzero exit, disagreement, cap/deadline or resource-close failure preserves all original evidence and stops later admissions. No key/path/alias/host fallback, automatic retry, reset, cleanup or substitution.",
    "All six success reports and original job/observer closures are inputs to the pure comparison. IP equality alone cannot establish route identity. Reported hardware model is not cryptographic hardware attestation.",
    "Actual model labels require separate explicit root approval against the observed models; this SOURCE leaves every approved model list null.",
    "Four final binary metadata templates remain unbound and are not part of the six-observation admission. They require final qualified native build artifacts and separate exact GO."
  ],
